  duplicate rare rerolls, guaranteed uber) translated to JavaScript from
  lib/battle-cats-rolls/gacha.rb and gacha_pool.rb.
- src/app.js: owned-cats code (encodeOwned / decodeOwned) translated from
  lib/battle-cats-rolls/owned.rb.
